使用try-catch包装并等待异步操作完成，或使用Task.Run处理后台任务：
```csharp
try
{
    var cards = FollowUpServer.ResetWorkInfoCache(req.WorkId, req.GroupType);
    await MySocketHelper.NoticeAll(...);
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    DingHelper.Push("tui_warn", "Socket推送失败", ...);
}
```

使用参数化查询，即使数据来源可信也应使用参数化：
```csharp
var sql = @"select count(1) from tb_ServerInfos where CpuUsage > @cpuUsage and IpTelecom in @ipList";
var thresholdExceededCount = Db.tbServerWeb.Get<int>(sql, new { cpuUsage, ipList = RestartServerList });
```

